        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current average technology per energy carrier.\n\n# Included processes\nIncluded are the shares of domestic electricity production by technology at the busbar. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
